But suppose g is not in H. Well, g H is then equal to all the things—because this thing has index 2—is equal to all the things in G that are not in H; I mean, I just partitioned the group into two pieces.

139
00:42:44,716 --> 00:42:55,863
但同理，右陪集H g 也是同一回事：它是 G 中所有不属于 H 的元素。所以它们相等：g H = H g。
But likewise, the right coset H g is the same thing: it's all the elements of G that are not in H. So these things are equal: g H equals H g.

140
00:42:55,863 --> 00:43:13,520
因此对所有 g 都有 g H g^{-1} = H，故 H 是正规子群！太棒了。噢对，对，抱歉。
