00:46:15,708 --> 00:46:27,494
这属于那种绕弯子的西罗论证，在这里问题在于：西罗 2-子群的阶不是 2，它们的阶是 4。
This is sort of one of these roundabout Sylow arguments where you have to keep—so here the issue is that Sylow 2-subgroups don't have order 2, they have order 4.

151
00:46:27,494 --> 00:46:39,816
所以例如，你不能保证它们两两相交只有平凡元。你知道对于素数阶子群，它们要么相等要么交集平凡；那很棒，但在这里我们并不知道这一点。
So for instance, you don't know that they have trivial intersection. You know that for prime-order subgroups, they're either equal or have trivial intersection; that's great, but we don't know that here.

152
00:46:39,816 --> 00:46:45,719
事实上你所做的反而是利用这个事实，但你必须非常谨慎。
In fact, what you do is you take advantage of this fact, but you have to be very careful about it.

153
00:46:45,719 --> 00:46:59,060
所以你要做的是证明：存在两个西罗 2-子群，其交集的阶恰好为 2；然后你可以证明其正规化子的指数必须为 5。
So what you want to do is show that there are Sylow 2-subgroups which have intersection of order 2, and then you can show that its normalizer must have index 5.

154
00:46:59,060 --> 00:47:20,097
让我先把这写下来，大家要是精力充沛可以回去自己补全细节：M 的构造，细节省略，但大体思路是：
So let me just write that down, and then you can go home if you're feeling energetic and work out the details: construction of M, details omitted, but here's the rough idea:

155
00:47:20,097 --> 00:47:57,239
证明存在西罗 2-子群 P 和 Q 使得其交集的阶恰好为 2——即交集包含 2 个元素；进而证明 P ∩ Q 的正规化子的阶——是阶，不是指数——必须是 12。
show there exist Sylow 2-subgroups P and Q such that the order of the intersection is exactly 2—so they intersect in 2 elements—and show then that the order of the normalizer of P intersect Q—the order, not the index—must be 12.

156
00:47:57,239 --> 00:48:15,369
具体做法是证明这些元素在其内部正规，它们必须与这里的元素交换，于是你最终得到了大量的元素，你最终在其中得到了大量非单位元，但你知道其大小必须有界，所以最终证明正规化子的阶必须是 12。
You do this by just sort of showing that these things must be normal, they must commute with the things in here, and so you end up getting a whole lot of elements, you end up getting a whole lot of non-identity elements in here, but you know that the size must be bounded, so you end up showing that the normalizer must be 12.

157
00:48:15,369 --> 00:48:24,010
这就是基本思路，纯粹是常见的组合技巧，与我们目前所做非常相似，这就足够了。
That's the basic idea, it's just the common combinatorial trickery, very much similar to what we've done so far, and this is enough.

158
00:48:24,010 --> 00:48:43,539
这个 M 就满足要求，它的指数是 5（60/12 = 5），太棒了！所以 M 就等于 P ∩ Q 在 G 中的正规化子。好的，这很棒。
This M suffices, it has index 5, so that's great! So M is equal to this normalizer of P intersect Q in G. Okay, so that's great.

159
00:48:43,539 --> 00:49:08,604
这就完全证明了 G 同构于 A_5。因此这就完成了 G 同构于 A_5 的证明。那么 A_n 呢？
